          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तसेच — tasec — \"likewise; as well as\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आम्ही पुस्तकं वाचली, तसेच गाणी ऐकली. āmhī pustakaṁ vāclī, tasec gāṇī aiklī. We read books and also listened to songs."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal; तसंच in speech. Built from तसे, in that way, and -च."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तसेच (tasec) is built from तसे, \"in that way\", and the stressing ending -च. तसा is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi tasā, \"suchlike\", under Sanskrit tādṛśa, \"suchlike\" (CDIAL 5760)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
