            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तो हुशार आहे, किंबहुना वर्गात सर्वात हुशार आहे. to huśār āhe, kimbahunā vargāt sarvāt huśār āhe. He is clever; in fact, the cleverest in the class."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal: it makes what was said stronger."
            }
          ]
        },
