          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किंबहुना (kimbahunā) is a tatsama phrase, taken whole from Sanskrit kiṁ, \"what\", and bahunā, \"with more\" (Monier-Williams): what need is there to say more."
